# =====================================================================
# THE MINES OF MORIA
# An adventure module for TUNNELS OF DOOM (PicoMite / PicoCalc),
# freely inspired by the dwarf-realm of Khazad-dum in the writings
# of J.R.R. Tolkien. Six levels down, three things to do, and a
# shadow at the bottom. All text here is original.
# =====================================================================

TITLE,Mines of Moria

INTRO,The East Gate stands open and the dark of Khazad-dum waits
INTRO,beyond it. Six levels below lie the helm and the axe of
INTRO,Durin, buried with his house when the mines were lost.
INTRO,Deeper still something waits that the dwarves woke and could
INTRO,not put down. Take back the treasures, then face Durin's Bane.

WIN,You climb into daylight with the helm and axe of Durin, and the shadow of the deep is ended. The dwarves will sing of this for an age.
FAIL,The dark closes over the stair. Moria keeps its treasures, and its shadow.

# --------------------------------------------------------------- mines
FLOORS,6
GRID,14,10
ROOMS,16
GOLD,180,150,120
